FIX_REASON: Include the owning C++ standard header in the translation unit instead of adding platform typedefs or toolchain feature leakage.

SCOPE: modules/audio_coding/neteq/reorder_optimizer.cc

VALIDATION: Ninja rebuilt reorder_optimizer.o successfully for //build/toolchain/aros:x64.

RISK: minimal; declaration-only portable include.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN: ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap
---
 modules/audio_coding/neteq/reorder_optimizer.cc | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/modules/audio_coding/neteq/reorder_optimizer.cc b/modules/audio_coding/neteq/reorder_optimizer.cc
index f6e073f..172f603 100644
--- a/modules/audio_coding/neteq/reorder_optimizer.cc
+++ b/modules/audio_coding/neteq/reorder_optimizer.cc
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
